# Architecture

## Layers

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  features/ (lobby, board-ui, online)    │  React, CSS modules
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  shared/ (ui, hooks, styles, utils)     │  React ok; no game rules
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  game/ (rules engine, board, moves)    │  NO React, NO fetch, NO DOM
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘

worker/  ──imports──►  game/ (shared types + validate/apply)
         Durable Object holds authoritative GameState
```

## Import rules

| From | May import |
| ---- | ---------- |
| `src/game/**` | Other `game/**` only |
| `src/shared/**` | `game/**` for types only if needed; never feature code |
| `src/features/**` | `game/**`, `shared/**`, other features via public `index.ts` only if intentional |
| `worker/**` | `src/game/**` (path alias `@game/`) — duplicate build config, no React |

**Forbidden:** `game/` importing React, `features/` importing Worker internals, circular feature imports.

## State

- **Local / CPU:** React state or `useReducer` driven by `game` reducers in `src/features/session/`.
- **Online:** Optimistic UI optional; server broadcast is truth. Client sends `{ type: 'intent', ... }`; never apply opponent moves locally without server ack.

## Shared rules

- `applyMove(state, action)` and `getLegalMoves(state)` live in `src/game/`.
- Worker calls the same functions after validating turn and seat.

## File placement

| Concern | Location |
| ------- | -------- |
| Board graph, indices | `src/game/board.ts` |
| Turn / dice / win | `src/game/rules.ts` |
| CPU scoring | `src/game/ai/` |
| Board SVG/DOM | `src/features/board/` |
| Room join UI | `src/features/lobby/` |
| DO room logic | `worker/room.ts` |
